{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>From his youth.</b> From his young days — an expression like ״בימי בחורותיך״. Another interpretation: from the choice ones, to serve Moses, for there were others with him." "<b>My master Moses, confine them.</b> In the house, and let them not prophesy in the camp — for the others to whom he gave permission prophesy discreetly, as it is written: ״ולקחת אותם אל אוהל מועד והתיצבו שם עמך״ — but these took no permission from you and prophesy outside the Tent of Meeting."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:30.226161123Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}